{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2022-01-06 15:32:00', 'title': 'AVANTA RESIDENTIAL REACHES FINANCIAL CLOSE FOR HOMES AT PAINTED TREE IN MCKINNEY, TEXAS', 'text': "DENVER, JAN. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AVANTA RESIDENTIAL TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE FIRM CLOSED THE CONSTRUCTION FINANCING FOR ITS PAINTED TREE BUILD-FOR-RENT PROJECT WITH J.P. MORGAN.\xa0 THIS MARKS AVANTA'S SECOND PROJECT UNDER THE AVANTA BRAND IN TEXAS AND J.P."}